msgid "Gaming & 3D Graphics"
msgstr "Mängimine ja 3D-graafika"

#: usr/share/big-kernel-manager/ui/mesa_data.py:93
msgid ""
"Vulkan and OpenGL libraries essential for games, Steam, Wine/Proton and 3D "
"applications."
msgstr ""
"Vulkani ja OpenGL-i raamatukogud on olulised mängude, Steami, Wine/Protoni "
