"32-bitine OpenGL – seda vajavad Steam, Wine/Proton ja vanemad 32-bitised "
"mängud"

#: usr/share/big-kernel-manager/ui/mesa_data.py:149
msgid "Video Playback"
msgstr "Video taasesitus"

#: usr/share/big-kernel-manager/ui/mesa_data.py:152
msgid ""
"Hardware-accelerated video decoding (VAAPI/VDPAU). Makes videos, streaming "
"and video calls smoother while reducing CPU and power usage."
msgstr ""
"Riistvaraga kiirendatud videodekodeerimine (VAAPI/VDPAU). Muudab videod, "
"voogesituse ja videokõned sujuvamaks, vähendades samal ajal protsessori- ja "
"energiakasutust."

#: usr/share/big-kernel-manager/ui/mesa_data.py:159
msgid "VAAPI for NVIDIA proprietary driver"
msgstr "VAAPI NVIDIA patenteeritud draiveri jaoks"

#: usr/share/big-kernel-manager/ui/mesa_data.py:165
msgid "VAAPI for Intel (Broadwell / Gen 8 and newer)"
msgstr "VAAPI Intelile (Broadwell / Gen 8 ja uuemad)"

#: usr/share/big-kernel-manager/ui/mesa_data.py:172
msgid "VAAPI for older Intel (Haswell to Coffee Lake / Gen 4–9)"
msgstr "VAAPI vanemale Intelile (Haswell to Coffee Lake / Gen 4–9)"

#: usr/share/big-kernel-manager/ui/mesa_data.py:179
msgid "VAAPI for AMD and NVIDIA open-source (Nouveau)"
msgstr "VAAPI AMD ja NVIDIA jaoks avatud lähtekoodiga (Nouveau)"

#: usr/share/big-kernel-manager/ui/mesa_data.py:186
msgid ""
"VDPAU for AMD/NVIDIA open-source — legacy API being replaced by VAAPI and "
"Vulkan. Probably not needed."
msgstr ""
"VDPAU AMD/NVIDIA avatud lähtekoodiga jaoks – pärand API asendatakse VAAPI ja "
"Vulkaniga. Ilmselt pole vaja."

#: usr/share/big-kernel-manager/ui/mesa_data.py:197
msgid "GPU Compute (AI / ML)"
msgstr "GPU arvutamine (AI / ML)"

#: usr/share/big-kernel-manager/ui/mesa_data.py:200
msgid ""
"CUDA and OpenCL libraries for artificial intelligence, machine learning, "
"Blender, DaVinci Resolve and other GPU-accelerated workloads."
msgstr ""
"CUDA ja OpenCL teegid tehisintellekti, masinõppe, Blenderi, DaVinci Resolve "
"ja muude GPU-ga kiirendatud töökoormuste jaoks."

#: usr/share/big-kernel-manager/ui/mesa_data.py:207
msgid "NVIDIA CUDA — TensorFlow, PyTorch, AI/ML"
msgstr "NVIDIA CUDA – TensorFlow, PyTorch, AI/ML"

#: usr/share/big-kernel-manager/ui/mesa_data.py:213
msgid "OpenCL for NVIDIA — Blender, DaVinci, Darktable"
msgstr "OpenCL NVIDIA jaoks – Blender, DaVinci, Darktable"

#: usr/share/big-kernel-manager/ui/mesa_data.py:219
msgid "OpenCL for AMD — Blender, GIMP, DaVinci"
msgstr "OpenCL AMD jaoks – Blender, GIMP, DaVinci"

#: usr/share/big-kernel-manager/ui/mesa_data.py:225
msgid "OpenCL for Intel — Blender, DaVinci"
msgstr "OpenCL Intelile – Blender, DaVinci"

#: usr/share/big-kernel-manager/ui/mesa_data.py:270
msgid "Stable"
msgstr "Stabiilne"

#: usr/share/big-kernel-manager/ui/mesa_data.py:272
msgid ""
"Officially tested by the Mesa team. The safest and most reliable choice for "
"everyday use, gaming, and video playback."
msgstr ""
"Ametlikult testitud Mesa meeskonna poolt. Kõige turvalisem ja "
"usaldusväärseim valik igapäevaseks kasutamiseks, mängimiseks ja video "
"taasesitamiseks."

